  "body": "In the [SerialOptions dictionary section](https://wicg.github.io/serial/#serialoptions-dictionary) `baudRate` is specified to be \"non-zero\"; however, in the [open() method section](https://wicg.github.io/serial/#open-method) it never specifies that `baudRate` should be checked for zero. Presumably there should be another step added, something like\n\nIf options[\"baudRate\"] is 0, reject promise with [TypeError](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#exceptiondef-typeerror) and return promise.",
